<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakhstan auctions 600 mln tenge bills June 23.</title>
<headline>Kazakhstan auctions 600 mln tenge bills June 23.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kazakhstan will auction 600 million tenge of six-month MKM discount Treasury bills on June 23, the National Bank said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Full details of the six-month issue:</p>
<p>    Series number		  KZ46K2512973</p>
<p>    Issue volume		   600 million tenge</p>
<p>    Denominations		  100 tenge</p>
<p>    Tenor			    182 days</p>
<p>    Issue date		     June 23</p>
<p>    Maturity date		  Dec 25, 1997</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
</text>
